WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:16.564
Peter and Benjamin were planning a harvest feast.

2
00:00:16.565 --> 00:00:21.718
"We need berries," Peter said.

3
00:00:21.719 --> 00:00:25.497
"Let's gather some nuts too," Benjamin said.

4
00:00:25.498 --> 00:00:34.962
"A harvest feast must have nuts!"

5
00:00:34.963 --> 00:00:46.122
The bunnies gathered some berries.

6
00:00:46.123 --> 00:00:54.833
Then they looked for nuts.

7
00:00:54.834 --> 00:01:00.048
Peter and Benjamin saw lots of squirrels.

8
00:01:00.049 --> 00:01:05.213
The squirrels were gathering nuts for winter.

9
00:01:05.214 --> 00:01:13.270
It was hard work!

10
00:01:13.271 --> 00:01:16.495
Peter and Benjamin put their nuts in a pile.

11
00:01:16.496 --> 00:01:19.610
"We have a big pile now," Peter said.

12
00:01:19.611 --> 00:01:22.954
"Hey!" shouted a squirrel.

13
00:01:22.955 --> 00:01:25.812
It was Timmy Tiptoes.

14
00:01:25.813 --> 00:01:28.642
Timmy ran toward the bunnies.

15
00:01:28.643 --> 00:01:30.999
He pointed at their big pile.

16
00:01:31.000 --> 00:01:35.280
"Are you stealing my nuts?" he asked.

17
00:01:35.281 --> 00:01:38.960
Timmy looked at Benjamin and Peter.

18
00:01:38.961 --> 00:01:41.083
"No," Peter said.

19
00:01:41.084 --> 00:01:45.429
"We collected these nuts."

20
00:01:45.430 --> 00:01:48.896
"Hmph!" Timmy looked mad.

21
00:01:48.897 --> 00:01:52.202
"I put my nuts right there."

22
00:01:52.203 --> 00:01:57.353
"Well, these are our nuts," Benjamin said.

23
00:01:57.354 --> 00:01:59.428
Timmy frowned.

24
00:01:59.429 --> 00:02:02.756
"Then where are my nuts?"

25
00:02:02.757 --> 00:02:12.111
Benjamin shrugged. "I don't know."

26
00:02:12.112 --> 00:02:18.987
"But we will find out!" Peter said.

